Feature: educational-grades

Owns this feature's browser presentation and client coordination: route
modules, feature components, TanStack Query hooks, React Hook Form definitions,
Zod schemas, typed API adapters, and feature-local types
(AI_DOCS/04_Project_Structure.md §3; 12_Frontend_Architecture.md §3).

A feature must not import another feature's internal implementation. Route
guards here are usability measures only; Laravel remains the authorization
authority.

This placeholder keeps the directory in version control while the feature is
empty. Remove it once the feature has its first module.
